msgid "Your e-mail"
msgstr "Do sheoladh ríomhphoist"

msgid "Select the language in which you want to receive the newsletters"
msgstr "Roghnaigh an teanga inar mian leat na nuachtlitreacha a fháil"

msgid "By checking this box, I confirm that I want to register for this service, and I agree with the @privacy_link"
msgstr "Trí thic a chur sa bhosca seo, dearbhaím gur mian liom clárú le haghaidh na seirbhíse seo agus go n-aontaím leis an @privacy_link"

msgid "privacy statement"
msgstr "ráiteas príobháideachais"

msgid "Subscribe"
msgstr "Liostáil"

msgid "You must agree with the privacy statement."
msgstr "Caithfidh tú glacadh leis an ráiteas príobháideachais."

msgid "You have been successfully subscribed."
msgstr "D’éirigh leat liostáil."

msgid "An error occurred while processing your request, please try again later. If the error persists, contact the site owner."
msgstr "Tharla earráid agus d’iarraidh á próiseáil – bain triail eile as ar ball. Má tharlaíonn an earráid arís, déan teagmháil le húinéir an tsuímh gréasáin."

msgid "Please select the newsletter lists you want to subscribe to."
msgstr "Roghnaigh na liostaí nuachtlitreacha ar mian leat liostáil dóibh."

msgid "Unsubscribe"
msgstr "Díliostáil"

msgid "Successfully unsubscribed!"
msgstr "D’éirigh leat díliostáil!"

msgid "Please select the newsletter lists you want to unsubscribe from."
msgstr "Roghnaigh na liostaí nuachtlitreacha ar mian leat díliostáil dóibh."
